# Level 1 has a guard in room 3, and the sword that lets the Prince fight
# him is in room 15 -- so when the player meets this guard he has no sword
# yet. This walks the route the player's own recording took: right along
# the middle row, down to the bottom one, back over the loose floor until
# it gives way, down into room 2, and right into room 3 where the guard is.
#
# The question it answers is what the original does when the Prince meets a
# guard he cannot fight.
level 1
cycles 400
settle 40
phase - 3
phase r 14
phase - 4
phase r 10
phase - 4
phase l 8
phase - 12
phase r 16
phase - 16
